>3)	I have 23 luckstones (polypiling is wonderful isn't it).  Does each
>	luckstone give +1 luck as well as stopping luck from timing out?

No. It doesn't make any difference in your luck whether you have 1 or 100
luckstones. But if you have a BLESSED luckstone, it adds +3 to your luck and
it only stops good luck from timing out while letting bad luck time out
normally. And if you have some blessed and some cursed luckstones, I guess
it is which ones you have more in your inventory.
You might like carry a blessed luckstone in your inventory and another one in
a bag as a backup if the one in your inventory gets cursed. In that case you
just ditch the cursed one and take the blessed one out of the bag.
Only the luckstones in your inventory make the difference for luck or timeout,
not the one(s) in a bag.

